    "detailed_description": "Cyberpunk Sister is a cool action game with  high speed and stylish action.<br>The combat system is very easy to understand, anyone can easily experience the gorgeous combat beyond imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934290/extras/0263d3892178fe0c1ad5a1371edd386f.poster.avif?t=1728964315\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934290/extras/0263d3892178fe0c1ad5a1371edd386f.webm?t=1728964315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934290/extras/0263d3892178fe0c1ad5a1371edd386f.mp4?t=1728964315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Air Combat System </h2>This is the main fight mode of the game, you can press only one button to launch the enemy to air, and perform crazy attacks to show your unparalleled technique.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Stylish Points System </h2>Remember flexibly change different attacks to fight the enemy,so you can earn more stylish points to enhance your damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Equip System </h2>The game has many equips or weapons, whether equip or underwear can change your pretty outfit. Take advantage of these equips to  make you stronger and prompts your adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Energy System </h2>Attack enemies can charge your energy, use the Ultimate Skill to kill all the enemies around? Or perform a Time-Slow? Or execute the elite enemy? It's all up to you.<br><br>QQ  Group\uff1a822587895<br>BiliBili\uff1a<br>Twitter\uff1a",
